# Web UI build settings. Copy to web/.env (gitignored).
#
# Browser key for the Google Maps JavaScript API, baked into the prerendered bundle by
# SvelteKit's $env/dynamic/public — public by design, so restrict it by HTTP referrer to your
# origins (plus http://localhost:5173/* and http://localhost:8787/* for local dev; Google
# rejects http://localhost:*/*) and to the Maps JavaScript API only.
# This is NOT the server-side GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY used for the Routes API.
#
# Optional: with no web/.env or an empty value the build still succeeds and the map area
# shows "Map unavailable".
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY=
